{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_015","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"The Amendments ledger entry type contains a list of Amendments that are currently active. Each ledger version contains at most one Amendments entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":2769,"char_end":2917,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_016","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"{\n\"Amendments\" : [\n\"42426C4D4F1009EE67080A9B7965B44656D7714D104A72F9B4369F97ABF044EE\" ,\n\"4C97EBA926031A7CF7D7B36FDE3ED66DDA5421192D63DE53FFB46E43B9DC8373\" ,\n// (... Long list of enabled amendment IDs ...)\n\"03BDC0099C4E14163ADA272C1B6F6FABB448CC3E51F522F978041E4B57D9158C\" ,\n\"35291ADD2D79EB6991343BDA0912269C817D0F094B02226C1C14AD2858962ED4\"\n],\n\"Flags\" : 0 ,\n\"LedgerEntryType\" : \"Amendments\" ,\n\"Majorities\" : [\n{\n\"Majority\" : {\n\"Amendment\" : \"7BB62DC13EC72B775091E9C71BF8CF97E122647693B50C5E87A80DFD6FCFAC50\" ,\n\"CloseTime\" : 779561310\n}\n},\n{\n\"Majority\" : {\n\"Amendment\" : \"755C971C29971C9F20C6F080F2ED96F87884E40AD19554A5EBECDCEC8A1F77FE\" ,\n\"CloseTime\" : 779561310\n}\n}\n],\n\"index\" : \"7DB0788C020F02780A673DC74757F23823FA3014C1866E72CC4CD8B226CD6EF4\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 143","char_start":2948,"char_end":3696,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_017","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"In addition to the common fields , the Amendments ledger entry has the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 145","char_start":3717,"char_end":3805,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_018","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Name JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 146","char_start":3809,"char_end":3859,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_019","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Amendments Array Vector256 No Array of 256-bit amendment IDs for all currently enabled amendments. If omitted, there are no enabled amendments.","location_hint":"paragraph 147","char_start":3863,"char_end":4006,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_020","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Majorities Array Array No Array of objects describing the status of amendments that have majority support but are not yet enabled. If omitted, there are no pending amendments with majority support.","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":4008,"char_end":4205,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_021","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"PreviousTxnID String UInt256 No The identifying hash of the transaction that most recently modified this entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":4207,"char_end":4318,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_022","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Requires the fixPreviousTxnID amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":4320,"char_end":4372,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_023","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"PreviousTxnLgrSeq Number UInt32 No The index of the ledger that contains the transaction that most recently modified this entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":4376,"char_end":4504,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_024","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Requires the fixPreviousTxnID amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 152","char_start":4506,"char_end":4558,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_025","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Each member of the Majorities field, if it is present, is an object with one field, Majority , whose contents are a nested object with the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":4564,"char_end":4720,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_026","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Name JSON Type Internal Type Description","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":4724,"char_end":4764,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_027","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Amendment String UInt256 The Amendment ID of the pending amendment.","location_hint":"paragraph 155","char_start":4768,"char_end":4835,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_028","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"CloseTime Number UInt32 The close_time field of the ledger version where this amendment most recently gained a majority.","location_hint":"paragraph 156","char_start":4837,"char_end":4957,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_029","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"In the amendment process , a consensus of validators adds a new amendment to the Majorities field using an EnableAmendment pseudo-transaction with the tfGotMajority flag when 80% or more of validators support it. If support for a pending amendment goes below 80%, an EnableAmendment pseudo-transaction with the tfLostMajority flag removes the amendment from the Majorities array. If an amendment remains in the Majorities field for at least 2 weeks, an EnableAmendment pseudo-transaction with no flags removes it from Majorities and permanently adds it to the Amendments field.","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":4961,"char_end":5538,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_030","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"Technically, all transactions in a ledger are processed based on which amendments are enabled in the ledger version immediately before it. While applying transactions to a ledger version where an amendment becomes enabled, the rules don&#x27;t change mid-ledger. After the ledger is closed, the next ledger uses the new rules as defined by any new amendments that applied.","location_hint":"paragraph 159","char_start":5548,"char_end":5920,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_031","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"There are no flags defined for the Amendments entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 161","char_start":5940,"char_end":5992,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_032","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"The Amendments entry does not require a reserve.","location_hint":"paragraph 163","char_start":6014,"char_end":6062,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_033","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"The ID of the Amendments entry is the hash of the Amendments space key ( 0x0066 ) only. This means that the ID is always:","location_hint":"paragraph 165","char_start":6086,"char_end":6207,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_034","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"7DB0788C020F02780A673DC74757F23823FA3014C1866E72CC4CD8B226CD6EF4","location_hint":"paragraph 166","char_start":6213,"char_end":6277,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_8ebf52ac0af9_035","source_id":"src_8ebf52ac0af9","source_hash":"823b76cb102a4a8c2624f6196a86711d77b1c513867b53557b7b1cf187e2e7fb","text":"(Don&#x27;t mix up the ID of the Amendments ledger entry type with the Amendment ID of an individual amendment.)","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":6279,"char_end":6391,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:11:56.882Z"}
